        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Endless ticker with a pause control and reduced-motion fallback</title>\n<style>\n  body { color: #111111; background: #ffffff; }\n  .ticker { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: #333333; animation: slide 3s linear infinite; }\n  .ticker.paused { animation-play-state: paused; }\n  @keyframes slide { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(200px); } }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .ticker { animation: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n  <a href=\"#main\" style=\"display: inline-block; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; line-height: 44px; padding: 0 8px\">Skip to main content</a>\n  <p>Order tracking</p>\n  <nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#main\" aria-current=\"page\" style=\"display: inline-block; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; line-height: 44px; padding: 0 8px\">Overview</a></nav>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n  <h1>Live departures</h1>\n  <div><div id=\"ticker\" class=\"ticker\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Moving departure board\"></div></div>\n  <button type=\"button\" id=\"pause\" style=\"min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px\"\n    onclick=\"document.getElementById('ticker').classList.toggle('paused')\">Pause animation</button>\n  <p>The board updates every minute.</p>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Footer text</p></footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
